    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wyred gives a new meaning to thinking ahead as you try to establish a connection with the other side. A single wrong move can become an uncrossable obstacle many-many steps later, cutting you off from your goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a little maintenance robot, looking after a lonely outpost on a distant planet, trying to reestablish a connection with the outpost's core. Enjoy over a hundred handcrafted puzzles with different campaign paths in this engaging sci-fi themed puzzle game.</p>",
